cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SegRA in your research, please cite this software."
title: "SegRA"
type: software

abstract: >-
  SegRA is a deterministic research verifier for assessing whether a deployed
  network segmentation architecture conforms to an intended architecture.
  It evaluates zone mappings, asset placement, defense-in-depth preservation,
  and security-control compliance, and generates JSON and PDF reports.

authors:
